# How this project is built

Started from the MedhKarm Python API starter. Keep to this structure so every part stays tested.

## Stack

{{stack_table}}

## Layout

- `app/main.py`: the FastAPI app and its routes; split into `app/routes/` as it grows.
- `app/store.py`: the data layer (SQLite: `DATABASE_PATH`, memory by default). Routes use
  only `store`, so a move to Postgres changes this file alone.
- `tests/`: pytest tests with FastAPI's `TestClient` (`python -m pytest -q`).

## Rules

- Works with no setup (memory database), so tests run anywhere.
- Never commit secrets: read settings from environment variables.
- Before finishing: `python -m pytest -q` passes.
